  "summary_en": "NSW Government end-user guidance from Cyber Security NSW (October 2023) with do/don't rules for using public generative AI tools such as ChatGPT and Gemini. It stresses fact-checking, not entering sensitive data, avoiding AI decision-making, and following internal policies.",
